# Enterprise Motion Standard (SoT)

CSS-first. Compose token/primitive từ `client/src/motion/` + utilities `vh-motion-*` / `vh-presence-*`. **Không** bật `framer-motion` trên feature pages. **Không** invent `@keyframes` / duration / easing ad-hoc.

Chi tiết API: `client/src/motion/tokens.js`, `client/src/motion/classes.js`, `client/src/index.css`.

## Tokens (khóa)

| Token | Giá trị | Dùng cho |
|-------|---------|----------|
| `--vh-motion-fast` / `VH_MOTION_FAST_MS` | 100ms | hover color, row, press |
| `--vh-motion-base` / `VH_MOTION_BASE_MS` | 150ms | button, input, tab fade, tooltip |
| `--vh-motion-slow` / `VH_MOTION_SLOW_MS` | 220ms | modal/drawer/page enter-exit |
| `--vh-motion-ease` | `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)` | mặc định |
| `--vh-motion-ease-out` | `cubic-bezier(0, 0, 0.2, 1)` | enter overlay |
| `--vh-motion-ease-in` | `cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 1, 1)` | exit overlay |
| Distance | 4px Y / 8px X / scale 0.96 | fade-up / slide / scale |

Nguyên tắc: ngắn, mượt — **không** bounce, spring mạnh, glow marketing.

## Map action → pattern

| Action | Pattern | Primitive |
|--------|---------|-----------|
| Click CTA | color 150ms + `active:scale(0.97)` | `vh-motion-btn` / `VH_MOTION_BTN` |
| Hover row | bg 100ms | `vh-motion-row` |
| Hover card | lift 2px + shadow; reduce tắt translate | `vh-motion-card` |
| Modal open/close | backdrop fade + panel scale; presence exit | `useMotionPresence` + `vh-presence-*` |
| Drawer | translateX 220ms | `vh-presence-drawer-right/left` |
| Sidebar submenu / accordion | grid-rows + fade-up 220ms | `NavCollapse` / `vh-nav-collapse` |
| Tab / segment | content `fade-in-fast` 150ms | `VH_MOTION_TAB_PANEL` |
| Route change | `PageMotion` fade-in-fast | `client/src/motion/PageMotion.jsx` |
| Popover | fade + 4px Y | `vh-presence-popover` |
| Toast | slide-up + fade | `FIGMA_TOAST_ROOT` (SoT) |
| Skeleton | `vh-skeleton`; reduce = static | existing |

## Presence (overlay)

```text
isOpen true  → mounted=true, phase=enter
isOpen false → phase=exit → sau duration (reduce=0) → mounted=false
```

- Public Modal/Confirm API giữ `isOpen` / `onClose`.
- A11y (`useModalA11y`) theo **logical** `isOpen`; visual theo `phase`.
- Exit: `pointer-events: none` trên overlay.

## Cấm

- `transition: all` mới (nợ `vh-transition` — alias, không nhân rộng).
- Animate `width` / `height` layout thrash — ưu tiên `opacity` + `transform`.
- Page-fade mỗi message chat/voice; invent keyframes feature khi đã có token.
- Dùng legacy `animate-fadeIn` / `animate-scaleIn` trên Shared mới — dùng `animate-fade-in` / `animate-scale-in` + presence.

## Reduced motion

Mọi primitive mới: `vh-motion-respect` + `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` → duration 0 / `animation: none` / không transform. Hook presence: duration 0 khi OS reduce.

## Checklist trước khi coi xong UI có motion

- [ ] Dùng token/class từ `client/src/motion` hoặc `vh-motion-*` / `vh-presence-*`
- [ ] Không thêm keyframes one-off trừ domain đặc thù (waveform, board DnD) đã out-of-scope SoT
- [ ] Có `motion-reduce` / `vh-motion-respect`
- [ ] Overlay mount/unmount qua `useMotionPresence` nếu cần exit
